  "identity": "light_shaft_cone",
  "title": "Fake volumetric light cone with dust",
  "purpose": "Additive spotlight beam on an open cone mesh: soft edges from the facing ratio, brightness falling off along the beam, drifting dust specks, and a soft fade where the cone meets geometry using the depth buffer.",
